<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95894" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπερχνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρχω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hasty, hurried</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγελοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					286
				</span></i>
			; of diseases and pains, <i>violent.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, al.: neut. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπερχνὸν κοτέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					454
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>hastening, pressing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (glossed by <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπερχνοποιός</span></b> ). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος ἱέρακος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περκνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
